{"id":"64c8defddc97b09a","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_AxPres.md","title":"AxPres","display":"AxPres","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"AxPres","parameters":["a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"AxPres"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：对象理论公理代码。有序参数：<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ AxPres a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists b\n  (and (or (@ PresBaseRaw b) (or (@ PresInductionRaw b) (@ PresCongruenceRaw b))) (@ PresUC b a)))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"06c53a1af06db581\" href=\"?note=06c53a1af06db581\" title=\"ZFC_PresBaseRaw\">PresBaseRaw</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9d346b0502ee15c4\" href=\"?note=9d346b0502ee15c4\" title=\"ZFC_PresCongruenceRaw\">PresCongruenceRaw</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b07023840bdaf7be\" href=\"?note=b07023840bdaf7be\" title=\"ZFC_PresInductionRaw\">PresInductionRaw</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b5719f983c5219c1\" href=\"?note=b5719f983c5219c1\" title=\"ZFC_PresUC\">PresUC</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ AxPres a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_PresBaseRaw","status":"resolved","id":"06c53a1af06db581","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_PresBaseRaw|PresBaseRaw]]；[[ZFC_PresCongruenceRaw|PresCongruenceRaw]]；[[ZFC_PresInductionRaw|PresInductionRaw]]；[[ZFC_PresUC|PresUC]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_PresCongruenceRaw","status":"resolved","id":"9d346b0502ee15c4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_PresBaseRaw|PresBaseRaw]]；[[ZFC_PresCongruenceRaw|PresCongruenceRaw]]；[[ZFC_PresInductionRaw|PresInductionRaw]]；[[ZFC_PresUC|PresUC]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_PresInductionRaw","status":"resolved","id":"b07023840bdaf7be","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_PresBaseRaw|PresBaseRaw]]；[[ZFC_PresCongruenceRaw|PresCongruenceRaw]]；[[ZFC_PresInductionRaw|PresInductionRaw]]；[[ZFC_PresUC|PresUC]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_PresUC","status":"resolved","id":"b5719f983c5219c1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_PresBaseRaw|PresBaseRaw]]；[[ZFC_PresCongruenceRaw|PresCongruenceRaw]]；[[ZFC_PresInductionRaw|PresInductionRaw]]；[[ZFC_PresUC|PresUC]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":913,"backlinks":[{"id":"ed8ec2c6db773694","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_AxPres|AxPres]]"},{"id":"5d935c80534ff30c","an